{"id":"vod_sn_35854","vodId":"35854","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"织田信奈的野望","name_cn":"织田信奈的野望","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c68c205395304b84ca84c3873cb760a3.jpg"},"summary":"相良良晴（江口拓也 配音）是一名平凡的高中生，某日，在一场意外之中，他竟然穿越回了群雄争霸的战国时代。在那里，相良良晴震惊的发现，在这里，那些史书中拼杀在前线的枭雄们，竟然都是可爱的女孩子！　　本想效忠于织田家的木下藤吉郎（盐屋翼 配音）壮志未酬身先死，相良良晴则在误打误撞之中代替了他的位置来到了织田家。在这里，相良良晴结识了身为十六岁少女的织田信奈（伊藤加奈惠 配音），成为辅佐她的家臣。在共同经历了各种腥风血雨危难时刻后，相良良晴和织田信奈之间也产生了真挚的感情。无奈，相良良晴并不属于这个时代，他和织田信奈之间的感情会迎来完满的结局吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kk90DsPhNf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K5rzsZncEf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TQbiLyhnHe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WGXq6sMALu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tMq7Umkptw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M1fbEsnTHb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WNEeWcRWNj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0qeJ4zRLgn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UCD7qMH0uR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/z7CXbCm78K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b11ir1iqVy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bu5bGxMyhG1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.896Z"}